{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GL1VfhpfKskYwXNn25NiA6","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Cloudflare Workers script size limit 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Limits · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/limits/\"},{\"title\":\"Deploy larger Workers — up to 64 MiB for both free and paid plans · Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-09-04-increased-worker-size-limit/\"},{\"title\":\"Limits · Cloudflare Workflows docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workflows/reference/limits/\"},{\"title\":\"Limits · Cloudflare D1 docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/d1/platform/limits/\"},{\"title\":\"Limits · Cloudflare Workers KV docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/kv/platform/limits/\"},{\"title\":\"Workers for Platforms Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/product/workers-for-platforms/\"},{\"title\":\"Workers KV - free to try, with increased limits!\",\"url\":\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/workers-kv-free-tier/\"},{\"title\":\"Workers, Now Even More Unbound: 15 Minutes, 100 Scripts, and No Egress Fees\",\"url\":\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/workers-now-even-more-unbound/\"},{\"title\":\"Limits · Cloudflare Agents docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/platform/limits/\"},{\"title\":\"Workers Analytics Engine — Limits · Cloudflare Analytics docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/analytics/analytics-engine/limits/\"}]\n\nThe current limit is **64 MiB uncompressed** on both Free and Paid plans, and the older compressed limits have been removed.\n\n- **Current docs:** Cloudflare's limits page lists Worker size at 64 MiB for both plans and says there is no compressed size limit. Only the uncompressed bundle size counts.\n- **Changelog:** A changelog entry from about 37 days ago says the earlier compressed caps of 3 MB (Free) or 10 MB (Paid) has been removed.\n- **Stale pages:** The Workflows limits page (about 20 days old) and the Agents limits page (about 174 days old) still cite the 3 MB and 10 MB compressed figures. Those appear to be outdated.\n- **Checking size:** Running `wrangler deploy --outdir bundled/ --dry-run` reports the uncompressed size, which is the number that counts against the limit.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7df62f22-cef2-4628-a18c-c85cd8d96bd4","uuid":"50adbe87-1e32-40fe-a822-a885bcae5064","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:47:15.967Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Cloudflare Workers script size limit 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01WQ3igNWXV2Z6jtDwFq9Ltf","content":[{"title":"Limits · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/limits/"},{"title":"Deploy larger Workers — up to 64 MiB for both free and paid plans · Changelog","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-09-04-increased-worker-size-limit/"},{"title":"Limits · Cloudflare Workflows docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workflows/reference/limits/"},{"title":"Limits · Cloudflare D1 docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/d1/platform/limits/"},{"title":"Limits · Cloudflare Workers KV docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/kv/platform/limits/"},{"title":"Workers for Platforms Changelog","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/product/workers-for-platforms/"},{"title":"Workers KV - free to try, with increased limits!","url":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/workers-kv-free-tier/"},{"title":"Workers, Now Even More Unbound: 15 Minutes, 100 Scripts, and No Egress Fees","url":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/workers-now-even-more-unbound/"},{"title":"Limits · Cloudflare Agents docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/platform/limits/"},{"title":"Workers Analytics Engine — Limits · Cloudflare Analytics docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/analytics/analytics-engine/limits/"}]},"The current limit is **64 MiB uncompressed** on both Free and Paid plans, and the older compressed limits have been removed.\n\n- **Current docs:** Cloudflare's limits page lists Worker size at 64 MiB for both plans and says there is no compressed size limit. Only the uncompressed bundle size counts.\n- **Changelog:** A changelog entry from about 37 days ago says the earlier compressed caps of 3 MB (Free) or 10 MB (Paid) has been removed.\n- **Stale pages:** The Workflows limits page (about 20 days old) and the Agents limits page (about 174 days old) still cite the 3 MB and 10 MB compressed figures. Those appear to be outdated.\n- **Checking size:** Running `wrangler deploy --outdir bundled/ --dry-run` reports the uncompressed size, which is the number that counts against the limit."],"durationSeconds":4.060298899999999,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GL1VfhpfKskYwXNn25NiA6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
